WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit nineteen. Crossing the Road!

2
00:00:04.307 --> 00:00:07.885
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.935 --> 00:00:11.234
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:15.104
Today we learn about Crossing the Road. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.295 --> 00:00:19.795
Road. Say it with me. Road!

6
00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:26.395
Stop. Say it with me. Stop!

7
00:00:29.894 --> 00:00:32.760
Look. Say it with me. Look!

8
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.777
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

9
00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:47.296
Hold hands. Say it with me. Hold hands!

10
00:00:50.781 --> 00:00:53.931
Car. Say it with me. Car!

11
00:00:57.439 --> 00:01:01.322
Motorbike. Say it with me. Motorbike!

12
00:01:04.803 --> 00:01:07.903
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:11.402 --> 00:01:19.586
Before I cross the road, I stop, look, and listen for a car or motorbike. I hold hands with an adult. I cross only when it is safe.

14
00:01:19.636 --> 00:01:20.889
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.211 --> 00:01:27.499
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.549 --> 00:01:28.699
Look!

17
00:01:29.403 --> 00:01:34.579
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.629 --> 00:01:35.779
Motorbike!

19
00:01:36.869 --> 00:01:42.959
Did you know? Looking left, right and left again helps you see traffic coming from both sides!

20
00:01:43.009 --> 00:01:44.974
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:54.340
Think and answer. Who should you hold hands with when you cross the road?

22
00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.540
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:01.650
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.391
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

